## 0. Step 0 — spec 修订前置门（`&&` 形态；用户裁决 2026-10-21）

命令 `gate-and.sh` 逐字（四个赋值各自换行、无 `;`；`set -uo pipefail` 不带 `-e` 以捕获每个赋值 rc；末尾单条 `&&` 链断言四个 rc 为 0 且四个计数 ≥ 1）：

```bash
set -uo pipefail
a=$(awk '/^### D2 架构/,/^\*\*依赖方向\*\*/' docs/superpowers/specs/202610202129-moon-langdetect-语种检测-spec.md | grep -c 'unicode_block')
r1=$?
b=$(awk '/^## 4A\./,/^## 5\./' docs/superpowers/specs/202610202129-moon-langdetect-语种检测-spec.md | grep -c 'cmd/golden')
r2=$?
c=$(awk '/^## 4A\./,/^## 5\./' docs/superpowers/specs/202610202129-moon-langdetect-语种检测-spec.md | grep -c 'gen_core_tables')
r3=$?
d=$(awk '/^## 4A\./,/^## 5\./' docs/superpowers/specs/202610202129-moon-langdetect-语种检测-spec.md | grep -c 'c6_zero_network')
r4=$?
printf 'unicode_block=%s cmd/golden=%s gen_core_tables=%s c6_zero_network=%s\n' "$a" "$b" "$c" "$d"
printf 'rc_unicode_block=%s rc_cmd/golden=%s rc_gen_core_tables=%s rc_c6_zero_network=%s\n' "$r1" "$r2" "$r3" "$r4"
test "$r1" -eq 0 && test "$r2" -eq 0 && test "$r3" -eq 0 && test "$r4" -eq 0 && test "$a" -ge 1 && test "$b" -ge 1 && test "$c" -ge 1 && test "$d" -ge 1
```

